OL,3,GNEWSAItalian mayor supports Cherries
OL,4,Afor AC Milan game
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town mayor who hails from Milan has
OL,7,Fsaid there will be no divided loyalties
OL,8,Fwhen his adopted home side, AFC
OL,9,FBournemouth, host AC Milan.
OL,11,FBournemouth mayor Roberto Rocca
OL,12,Finsists, despite his family supporting
OL,13,Fthe Italian visitors, he will be
OL,14,Fcheering mostly for the Cherries at
OL,15,FThursday's Europa League game.
OL,17,FThe mayor, who has lived in Bournemouth
OL,18,Ffor 13 years, called the tie a
OL,19,F"fantastic opportunity".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
