OL,3,GNEWSAItalian mayor supports Cherries
OL,4,Afor AC Milan game
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "I think it's happening once
OL,7,Fin your life, for Bournemouth having
OL,8,FMilan playing here and for me to be the
OL,9,Fmayor when Bournemouth are in the
OL,10,FEuropean league as well."
